      ],
      "reason": "The route overview's architect paragraph said the Architect runs no tests, builds or failure investigations in his own chat. It now says the Architect neither writes onboarding nor lets its own checks stand in for a leaf's build, review, curation or gate, that he may check, measure, run and read on a copy for his own rulings, and that only a check or investigation he does not do himself goes under delegation to the coordinators and their owning roles. The repaired sentence keeps the own-check permission distinct from the delegated case, which the earlier wording narrowed, and keeps the direct-coordination closeout boundary.",
